(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - INDUSTRIES DEPARTMENT, GOVERNMENT OF MAHARASHTRA) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: CHIEF MINISTER EMPLOYMENT GENERATION PROGRAMME \(CMEGP\) MAHARASHTRA \(CMEGP-MH\) / DIRECTORATE OF INDUSTRIES, MAHARASHTRA / KVIB) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Maharashtra state credit-linked subsidy initiative providing margin money) Tj
T*
(assistance to youth and micro-entrepreneurs for setting up manufacturing) Tj
T*
(and service units.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Resident of Maharashtra state between 18 and 45 years of age \(up to 50) Tj
T*
(   for SC/ST/Women/Ex-servicemen\).) Tj
T*
(2. Minimum Class 7th pass for project cost up to Rs. 10 Lakh, Class 10th pass) Tj
T*
(   for project cost above Rs. 10 Lakh.) Tj
T*
(3. Only new manufacturing or service units established within the State of) Tj
T*
(   Maharashtra.) Tj
T*
(4. Existing units cannot apply.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Margin money subsidy of 15% to 35% of project cost: up to Rs. 50 Lakh for) Tj
T*
(   manufacturing projects and Rs. 20 Lakh for service units. 10% higher) Tj
T*
(   subsidy in rural and backward talukas.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 35.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 17.5 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Maharashtra Domicile Certificate) Tj
T*
(2. Aadhaar Card & PAN Card) Tj
T*
(3. Educational Marksheet \(7th or 10th\)) Tj
T*
(4. Detailed Project Report \(DPR\)) Tj
T*
(5. Undertaking / Affidavit on non-beneficiary of other subsidy schemes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via Maha-CMEGP Portal \(maha-cmegp.gov.in\)) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://maha-cmegp.gov.in) Tj
T*
ET
